    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bitcoin-Price-Falls-Below-72000-as-Nvidia-CEO-Jensen-Huang-Steps-Down-and-Strategy-MSTR-Slides.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-slips-near-64000-strategy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Slips Below $64,000 as Strategy (MSTR) Falls Below $100</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin price slipped near $64,000 Tuesday afternoon as Strategy (MSTR) shares fell below the company's STRC preferred and Coinbase and other crypto stocks declined.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-slips-near-64000-strategy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Slips Below $64,000 as Strategy (MSTR) Falls Below $100</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
