    "title": "Situational Awareness Dumps Bitcoin Miners After Citadel Sale",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/aschenbrenner-fund-dumps-bitcoin-miners",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AI-Hyperscalers-Are-Pricing-Bitcoin-Miners-Off-the-Grid-and-Why-Its-a-Win-Win.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/aschenbrenner-fund-dumps-bitcoin-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Situational Awareness Dumps Bitcoin Miners After Citadel Sale</a></p>\n<p>Situational Awareness, the AI fund run by Leopold Aschenbrenner, cut IREN about 94% and exited Core Scientific, Riot and Hive in the third quarter, leaving $80.8 million in three miner stocks after a July sale to Citadel.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/aschenbrenner-fund-dumps-bitcoin-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Situational Awareness Dumps Bitcoin Miners After Citadel Sale</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AI-Hyperscalers-Are-Pricing-Bitcoin-Miners-Off-the-Grid-and-Why-Its-a-Win-Win.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/aschenbrenner-fund-dumps-bitcoin-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Situational Awareness Dumps Bitcoin Miners After Citadel Sale</a></p>\n<p>Situational Awareness, the AI fund run by Leopold Aschenbrenner, cut IREN about 94% and exited Core Scientific, Riot and Hive in the third quarter, leaving $80.8 million in three miner stocks after a July sale to Citadel.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/aschenbrenner-fund-dumps-bitcoin-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Situational Awareness Dumps Bitcoin Miners After Citadel Sale</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
